WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.602
Six-vertex heights become Gaussian noise.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.480
Ice rules on a square grid define a random height landscape.

3
00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.592
Zoomed out, physics says it looks like a Gaussian free field.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.993
Claimed: the whole range, with the variance physics predicted.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.021
No Lean; a single manuscript.
